ce: Collection of Four Science Fiction Books Dive into the cosmos with Into the Space, a spellbinding collection of four science fiction masterpieces that promise to transport you to distant worlds and thrill you with tales of heroism, survival, and unyielding courage. 1. Beyond the Stars: The Galactic Battle for Survival Step into a universe teetering on the brink of chaos with Beyond the Stars: The Galactic Battle for Survival. In our galaxy plagued by a tyrannical warlord, one hero stands against the darkness: Om. After being captured by the enemy's ruthless forces, Om must navigate treacherous traps, outwit deadly enemies, and harness advanced technology to thwart the warlord's sinister plans. Masterfully weaving action, suspense, and romance, this epic space opera will leave you yearning for more. 2. Lost in Space Embark on an interstellar journey of survival, intellect, and heart in Lost in Space. When Sarthak Strain, the son of a legendary space explorer, finds himself stranded in the vast expanse of space, he must rely on his wits and courage to navigate through a universe more intricate and dangerous than he ever imagined. With the help of Nia, a mysterious girl with her own secrets, and Angli, a genius engineer, Sarthak battles against Miylee, a being of pure energy bent on capturing the brightest minds across galaxies. 3. Dhruv Stran in Unknown Space Join Dhruv, a boy who loves flying, as he sets off for the Himalayas wearing what he thinks is a jet suit. But this suit, called Stran, turns out to be a door to outer space, and suddenly, Dhruv is soaring among the stars. Caught by a Blue Worm Hole, he's taken to a far-off part of space that no one knows. There, he meets a see-through king who rules over robots. In a strange and hostile environment, Dhruv must use his cleverness and bravery to escape the robot king and find his way back to Earth. 4. Trapped in the Bushes Embark on an extraordinary journey with The Alien. This riveting tale takes \n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user's search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'integer'}, 'reason': {'description': 'Concise explanation (1-3 sentences) justifying the score. Used for auditing and debugging.', 'title': 'Reason', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['score', 'reason'], 'title': 'RelevanceScore', 'type': 'object', 'additionalProperties': False}, 'name': 'RelevanceScore', 'strict': True}}, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.0}}
