rth ?\n\nDescription:\nThey didn't come with war. They came with questions. When mysterious signals disrupt Earth's communication networks, the world braces for the unthinkable. Then, the sky opens. Massive alien ships descendbut no invasion follows. What unfolds instead is a profound, unsettling, and exhilarating global reckoning. What If...: Aliens Landed on Earth ? is a gripping speculative journey into humanity's first contact with intelligent extraterrestrial life. Told through the lens of a mock-documentary, it explores the cascading effects of their arrivalfrom military lockdowns and political unrest to groundbreaking scientific breakthroughs, moral dilemmas, and spiritual crises. As governments struggle for control, scientists race to decode alien communication, and religious leaders question the meaning of creation, one truth becomes clear: the future of humanity may no longer be in our hands. This thrilling companion to the acclaimed docu-series combines realism, emotion, and philosophical depth to ask the ultimate question: Are we truly ready for what's out thereor even for what's inside ourselves? A story of awe, fear, and possibilityperfect for fans of speculative fiction, science documentaries, and thought-provoking drama.\n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user's search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'integer'}, 'reason': {'description': 'Concise explanation (1-3 sentences) justifying the score. Used for auditing and debugging.', 'title': 'Reason', 'type': 's