iption:\nAre you tired of feeling trapped in the darkness of alcohol addiction? Do you feel like you\'ve tried everything to break free, but nothing seems to work? You\'re not alone. In fact, millions of people around the world struggle with alcohol addiction every day. It\'s a common pain that can be difficult to overcome, but there is hope. Introducing "From Darkness to Light: The Journey Through Alcohol Addiction Recovery," a book that offers a comprehensive guide to help you overcome your addiction and find your way to a brighter, more fulfilling future. This book is packed with practical tips, advice, and strategies that will help you break free from the grips of alcohol addiction. Here are just a few of the things you\'ll discover: The root causes of alcohol addiction and how to address them head-on Strategies for overcoming cravings and temptations Tools for managing stress and anxiety without turning to alcohol Tips for rebuilding relationships and finding support during your recovery journey and much more... But perhaps you\'re thinking, "I\'ve tried recovery before and it didn\'t work for me." Don\'t worry, this book takes a fresh and easy-to-follow approach to recovery that has helped countless people find success. Don\'t wait any longer to take control of your life and break free from the darkness of alcohol addiction. Get your copy and start your journey to a brighter future!\n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user\'s search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'inte