nDescription:\nAre you struggling to find the drive to achieve your goals? Do you wonder why motivation often fades away just when you need it most? The Science of Motivation: Unlocking Your Inner Drive is your ultimate guide to understanding the powerful psychological and neurological forces that fuel your ambition-and how to harness them to transform your life. Drawing on the latest research in neuroscience and behavioral psychology, this book reveals how your brain's reward system, dopamine pathways, and emotional regulation work together to ignite motivation. You'll discover the difference between intrinsic and extrinsic motivation, and why aligning your goals with personal values is essential for lasting success. Inside, you'll find proven strategies to set SMART goals, build positive habits, and overcome the paralyzing grip of procrastination. Learn how to break bad habits and develop mental toughness through resilience training and mindfulness techniques. Understand the science behind habit formation, willpower development, and how to use positive reinforcement to maintain momentum. Whether you're aiming to boost productivity at work, excel in education, improve health and fitness, or grow personally, this book offers practical tools like visualization, journaling, and accountability systems that adapt to your unique motivation style and personality traits. Explore how emotional intelligence and mindset shifts-such as adopting a growth mindset-play a crucial role in sustaining motivation over the long haul. Avoid burnout by mastering stress management and balancing rest with ambition. The Science of Motivation isn't just theory-it's a comprehensive personal development plan to unlock your inner drive, build unstoppable momentum, and achieve meaningful success. If you're ready to break free from self-doubt, procrastination, and confusion, this book will empower you with the knowledge and techniques to take control of your motivation and make your dreams a reality. Discover t\n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user's search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'integer'}, 'reason': {'description': 'Concise explanation (1-3 sentences) justifying the score. Used for auditing and debugging.', 'title': 'Reason', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['score', 'reason'], 'title': 'RelevanceScore', 'type': 'object', 'additionalProperties': False}, 'name': 'RelevanceScore', 'strict': True}}, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.0}}
