iller where ancient evil awakens-and the fate of humanity teeters on the edge of darkness. When journalist Damian Hunter's wife falls into an unexplained coma, his desperate search for answers leads him into the forbidden underworld of vampire politics, demonic possession, and a conspiracy older than civilization itself. Twelve years after vampires revealed themselves to the world, a secret Council of seven immortal lords controls global wealth, power, and blood. At the center of this shadow empire sits Luciaus-an ancient being born of a cursed ritual, ruling from the Red Throne with charm and brutality in equal measure. But something even older than the Council is stirring. Whispers plague Damian's dreams. Shadows twist behind hospital walls. And a forbidden tome-the NarShian-may hold the key to saving his wife... or damning him forever. As Damian dives deeper, he uncovers a cosmic war that never ended-between Heaven's betrayed angels and the fallen Ones who seek to rise again. Ancient Austria, present-day Boston, and Vienna's blood-soaked palaces become battlegrounds for souls, secrets, and power. And the deeper he goes, the more he begins to change. Darkness offers him a choice: serve it-or be consumed. A blend of supernatural horror, political intrigue, and theological dread, The Old Lords explores how faith, grief, and ambition twist in the hands of eternal predators. Buy now and discover the darkness behind the throne. Dare to enter the shadows but don't look too long into the abyss...\n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user's search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevanc